              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A bamboo grove? (वेणुवनम्, veṇuvanam.) A rainbow? (इन्द्रधनुः, indradhanuḥ.) Hail? (करका, karakā.) Dew? (अवश्यायः, avaśyāyaḥ.) Moonlight? (ज्योत्स्ना, jyotsnā.) A deer? (हरिणः, hariṇaḥ.) A leopard? (चित्रकः, citrakaḥ.) A rhinoceros? (गण्डकः, gaṇḍakaḥ.) A nest? (नीडम्, nīḍam.) An egg? (अण्डम्, aṇḍam.) A sentence? (वाक्यम्, vākyam.) A language? (भाषा, bhāṣā.) Grammar? (व्याकरणम्, vyākaraṇam.) Mathematics? (गणितम्, gaṇitam.) Science? (विज्ञानम्, vijñānam.)"
